<title>BELGIUM: Coil H1 sales up 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Coil H1 sales up 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs)</p>
<p>    Sales				   302    vs   244</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian aluminum coatings firm Coil said sales of new products amounted to 25 million Belgian francs.</p>
<p>Coil, listed on the Nouveau Marche of the Paris bourse, said in a statement it expected sales to develop favourably in the second half and that the share of new products would increase.</p>
<p>It said it had potential orders worth 887 million francs at the end of June, up from 339 million at the end of the first quarter.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
